                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>• All values in this report include food, dmarts and local store vertical only.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>• Vendor includes food restaurants. (However, the term ‘restaurant’ is used as it is when referring to food service only.)</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>• All monetary values are in </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans CJK KR Black' fontsize='10'>€ (Euro)</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
